          "id": "occurrence-3044fc3912e5b79375dac5b2cc343e034c8c51db854d295b6a5d152918e806e4-bec34d90fd405560",
          "judge": "openai-codex/gpt-5.6-luna",
          "quote_span": "In November 2025, HUD issued a notice similar to the prior notices, 15 saying that the term “federal public benefit” would apply to all HUD-issued grants and to any benefit or service provided to individuals, households or families, under programs including Continuum of Care and Emergency Solutions Grants for homelessness services; HOME, HOME-ARP, and the Housing Trust Fund for affordable housing and rental assistance; housing assistance for people with HIV/AIDS; and Community Development Block Grant (CDBG) and CDBG-Disaster Relief for local community-development and disaster-recovery housing aid.",
